# --- logs: untrack everything except the model benchmark (2026-08-05) ---
# These were tracked BEFORE .gitignore existed, so the ignore rules never
# applied and they were published to the public repo. model_bench.json is
# kept: a code comment in analyze_telemetry.py cites it as the reason for
# the llama3.2:3b model choice.
